[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9300.23, "timestamp": "02:35:00", "text": "何でも。私は完全に、ええと、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9302.07, "timestamp": "02:35:02", "text": "私の弱みを握っているか。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9304.95, "timestamp": "02:35:04", "text": "ああ、大変だ。ええ、私には拳と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9311.19, "timestamp": "02:35:11", "text": "わかりました、では短いBをやります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9313.429, "timestamp": "02:35:13", "text": "攻撃を受けているのだと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9314.79, "timestamp": "02:35:14", "text": "わかった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9317.27, "timestamp": "02:35:17", "text": "どうすればいいですか？それをクリックしてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9320.469, "timestamp": "02:35:20", "text": "短い弓をカチッと鳴らして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9322.23, "timestamp": "02:35:22", "text": "そしてそれを標的にする。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9323.75, "timestamp": "02:35:23", "text": "はい、どうぞ。よし。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9326.95, "timestamp": "02:35:26", "text": "よし、クリックして攻撃だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9327.75, "timestamp": "02:35:27", "text": "おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9329.349, "timestamp": "02:35:29", "text": "それは完全な損傷です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9333.349, "timestamp": "02:35:33", "text": "わかった。ああ、わかった、ダメージを与えなきゃ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9334.71, "timestamp": "02:35:34", "text": "ええ、そうですね。したくないのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9338.71, "timestamp": "02:35:38", "text": "する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9346.469, "timestamp": "02:35:46", "text": "はい、これでよし。あれは損傷を受けた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9348.469, "timestamp": "02:35:48", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9349.99, "timestamp": "02:35:49", "text": "そして、それがあなたができることの全てだと思います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9351.349, "timestamp": "02:35:51", "text": "次はあなたの番です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9353.19, "timestamp": "02:35:53", "text": "はい、これでターンを終了します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9355.03, "timestamp": "02:35:55", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9356.63, "timestamp": "02:35:56", "text": "入力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9358.71, "timestamp": "02:35:58", "text": "走る"}]